  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a large saucepan with water, add a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil over high heat.\n• Cook penne in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 12 minutes.\n• Reserve pasta water(see ingredients). Drain penne, then return to saucepan.\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a734d15aa7b407b754ee/step-7f7cb900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When pasta has 5 minutes remaining, roughly chop semi-dried tomatoes.\n• Grate zucchini.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook zucchini and semi-dried tomatoes, tossing, until slightly softened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a734d15aa7b407b754ee/step-3db3b410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium, then stir in thickened cream, tomato & herb seasoning, stock concentrate and reserved pasta water and simmer, until slightly reduced 1-2 minutes.\n• Add cooked penne tossing until combined, 1 minute.\n• Season generously with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a734d15aa7b407b754ee/step-31e3b320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine spinach & rocket mix, a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Divide creamy semi-dried tomato penne between bowls. Crumble over marinated goat cheese. Spoon over some oil from goat cheese.\n• Serve with dressed leaves. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a734d15aa7b407b754ee/step-6912f230.jpg"
    }
  ]
